{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6b31640a-5a7b-8b58-8fa2-1ca362e0522e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T12:58:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anabela Monteiro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:56:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:56:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin. Yes. I'm calling about a storm drain. The grate is frozen... frozen shut, and the water is just spreading all across the intersection."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:56:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, frozen grate, water across the intersection. Where's this at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:56:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's four fifty-three Kingston Avenue. Historic Hill. Right at the corner there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:56:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four fifty-three Kingston. Got it. And is this from a storm? I'm looking at the weather and it's been pretty dry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:56:32-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no storm. It has been dry. That's the thing. It's just the melt running down in the afternoon, and then it freezes again at night, and the drain is... [pause] ...blocked. Every day, Kevin. Every single day this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:56:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. Ice sheets up over the grate and the water has nowhere to go. So it's pooling in the road, or is it up onto the sidewalks too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:56:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. The whole corner. People are walking out into the street to get around it. And it's icy, so... I'm worried someone will slip, honestly. I called about this kind of thing before and nothing happened."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:57:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I hear you. I'll put it in as a priority so they get eyes on it. Anything else you can see there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:57:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. There is also a manhole cover, close to the drain. It looks... off. Maybe an inch. Sitting higher on one side than the other. A car goes over it and it makes a noise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:57:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, manhole cover sitting about an inch off, near the drain, noisy when cars hit it. I'll note that separately so it doesn't get lost."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:57:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Hold on one second. [pause]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:57:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, the blue folder. It's the blue one, on my desk. Yes. Thank you. [pause] Sorry, Kevin. I'm back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:57:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. Let me grab a number for you, so somebody can reach you once it's handled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:58:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:58:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-seven. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:58:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anabela Monteiro. M-O-N-T-E-I-R-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:58:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Anabela. So that's the frozen grate at Kingston and the cross street, plus the manhole cover, and a callback to you when the crew's finished."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:58:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Please call me when it is done. Done, not just looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:58:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll make a note that you want the call after the work is complete. Probably the next day or two once they're out that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:58:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I will wait for the call. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T12:58:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Stay safe out there on that ice."
    }
  ],
